{"id":"348985e8f68576a3","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-nc.md","title":"df-nc (NC Complexity Class)","display":"df-nc (NC Complexity Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]","[[28-df-circuit-depth]]"],"display":"df-nc (NC Complexity Class)","label":"28-df-nc","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-nc","NC","NC Complexity Class"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.24","source_printed_pages":"117–118","source_pdf_pages":"143–144","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" href=\"?note=f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" title=\"28-df-circuit-depth\">28-df-circuit-depth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nc (NC Complexity Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-nc"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-nc</span><span>NC</span><span>NC Complexity Class</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.24"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"117–118"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"143–144"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BF}\">\\(\\operatorname{BF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}\">\\(\\operatorname{depth}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" href=\"?note=f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" title=\"28-df-circuit-depth\">28-df-circuit-depth</a>。</li>\n<li>电路族采用非一致约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FNC}\">\\(\\mathbf{FNC}\\)</span> 是本节点同时定义的多输出函数类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{NC}^k\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\ \\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil^k\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{NC}^k\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\ \\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil^k\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NC}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{NC}^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NC}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{NC}^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{FNC}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists k,a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists(C_n)_n\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\\;&amp;C_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m(n)}\\land\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land m(n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil^k\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=f(x)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{FNC}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists k,a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists(C_n)_n\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\\;&amp;C_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m(n)}\\land\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land m(n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil^k\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=f(x)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>有界扇入是定义的形式条件；对数空间一致性是可额外添加的条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.24，印刷页 117–118；PDF 页 143–144。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-depth","status":"resolved","id":"f62ab4c80ccedf7e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-depth]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}$、$\\operatorname{BF}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{size}$、$\\operatorname{depth}$ 分别见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-depth]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-depth","status":"resolved","id":"f62ab4c80ccedf7e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{size}$、$\\operatorname{depth}$ 分别见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-depth]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FNC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{NC}^k\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\ \\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [&\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil^k\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NC}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{NC}^k.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{FNC}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists k,a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists(C_n)_n\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\\;&C_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m(n)}\\land\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\\\\n&\\land m(n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil^k\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=f(x)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2127,"backlinks":[{"id":"17518c2952ef83e1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NC}^k$、$\\operatorname{BF}$ 与电路参数见 [[28-df-nc]]；$\\operatorname{LU}$ 见 [[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]。"},{"id":"cc24f2c1587a5632","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{FNC}$ 是 [[28-df-nc]] 中另行指定的多输出电路函数类；旧有 NC 归约变体以下标显式保留，均不作为原书 P 完全性的定义。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"一致性与电路类：[[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]、[[28-df-nc]]、[[28-df-nc1]]、[[28-df-ac0]]、[[28-df-tc0]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","14f69cc09dc02600","f62ab4c80ccedf7e"]}